{"unit_id":"2026heshao__dsh-armory#card-zh","repo":"2026heshao/dsh-armory","commit":"90c6dcaa96985329521903b53dd22b8fa4b8277f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"大肥鱼军械库（dsh-armory）是一款 DSH 网页插件面板，集中管理全局与项目 MCP、技能、WorkBuddy 专家和插件市场。它通过 DSH 的 mcpManager 服务及浏览器面板呈现连接状态、工具 Schema、导入和安装流程；工具裁缝汇总本机会话中的工具调用与上下文占用。还可浏览连接器、SkillHub 技能、专家与社区插件目录，并在会话中挂载专家人设。适合希望在一个界面整理 DSH 工具、技能和扩展的用户；安装命令为 dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-armory，市场目录可直接读取公开服务，远程 MCP 的授权由用户按需完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:5870-5907","lib/index.js:1305-1366","lib/index.js:1609-1618","lib/index.js:1998-2030"]}
{"unit_id":"2026heshao__dsh-armory#card-en","repo":"2026heshao/dsh-armory","commit":"90c6dcaa96985329521903b53dd22b8fa4b8277f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-armory is a DSH web panel for global/project MCP servers, skills, experts, and plugin markets. Host RPCs support status, imports, tool usage reports, installs, OAuth, and session personas. Install: `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-armory`; public catalogs need no account.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:5870-5907","lib/index.js:1305-1366","lib/index.js:1609-1618","lib/index.js:1998-2030"]}
